:: WLI Hallways Encounter
<<if $sexstart is 1>>
	<<set $sexstart to 0>>
	<<consensual>>
	<<set $consensual to 1>>
	<<neutral 1>>
<<elseif $molestationstart is 1>>
	<<set $molestationstart to 0>>
	<<controlloss>>
	<<violence 1>>
	<<neutral 1>>
	<<molested>>
<</if>>
<<set $enemytype to $wraith.type>>
<<set $rescue to 0>>
<<set $outside to 0>><<schooleffects>><<effects>><<effectsWraith>>

<<if _combatend>>
	<span id="next"><<link [[Next|WLI Hallways Encounter Finish]]>><</link>></span><<nexttext>>
<<else>>
	<span id="next"><<link [[Next|WLI Hallways Encounter]]>><</link>></span><<nexttext>>
<</if>>


:: WLI Hallways Encounter Finish
<<if $enemyhealth lte 0 and $wraith.type is "man">>
	The <<person>> looks down at you in shock as <<he>> staggers backwards.
	<<if $wraith.gen is "abomination">>
		The tentacles drop lifelessly to the ground, and sublimate into a pink mist.
	<<elseif $wraith.gen is "arms">>
		<<His>> extra arms fold back in.
	<</if>>
	<<if $wraith.state is "haunt">>
		"<span class="wraith">I will find you again, thief.</span>"
	<<else>>
		<<His>> head snaps back, and <<he>> dissipates into nothingness with a brief shriek that echoes in your mind. Your ears ring, and you think you hear laughter. "<span class="wraith">You'll see me soon. I'll see you sooner.</span>"
	<</if>>
	<br><br>
	<<tearful>> you run, not daring to look back.
	<<set $wraith.defeated++>>
<<else>>
	<<ejacW>>
	<<kissWraith>>
	<br><br>
	<<He>> breaks off and gives you a regal bow as <<he>> vanishes in a torrent of water, and <<his>> laughs echo between your ears. "<span class="wraith">We'll meet again. We'll meet again. We'll meet.</span>"
	<br><br>
	<<if $consensual>> 
		You look around, trying to understand if what just happened was real.
	<<else>>
		<<tearful>> you look around, trying to make sure <<hes>> really gone.
	<</if>>
<</if>>
<<clotheson>>
<<endcombat>>

<<link [[Next|Hallways]]>><<endWraith>><</link>>
<br>


:: WLI Hallways Baited
You and the <<person>> find a storeroom for some privacy.<br><br>
<<promiscuity2>>
<<He>> pushes you in first, and closes the door behind <<him>>. <<His>> skin has turned a stark white.<br>
"<span class="wraith"><<pcPetname "Wraith">>.</span>"

<br><br>
<<if $phase is 1>>
	<<endevent>>
	<<generateWraith 1 true>>
	<<initWraith "abomination">>
	<<link [[Next|WLI Hallways Encounter]]>><<set $sexstart to 1>><</link>>
<<else>>
	<<endevent>>
	<<generateWraith 1 true>>
	<<initWraith "abomination">>
	This isn't a student. <<trauma 12>><<ggtrauma>>
	<br><br>
	<<startWraith>>
	<br><br>
	<<link [[Next|WLI Hallways Encounter]]>><<set $molestationstart to 1>><</link>>
<</if>>
<br>


:: WLI Hallways Bait Resist
"<span class="wraith">You will bend. Or you will break.</span>"
<br><br>
This isn't a student. <<trauma 12>><<ggtrauma>>
<br><br>
<<generateWraith 1 true>>
<<initWraith "abomination">>
<<startWraith>>
<br><br>
<<link [[Next|WLI Hallways Encounter]]>><<set $molestationstart to 1>><</link>>
<br>